This project contains a new implementation informed by protocol and packaging
work from software owned by Oliver Bross, including OM0RX Flex Client,
RUMlog-Wavelog-Bridge, and Flex-WavelogGate.

The Windows Remote Station Agent was migrated from Oliver Bross's
`om0rx-radio-control` repository at commit
`303ed2ada204172c2fc689337fa753ce29707d3f`. Its original authorship and
GPL-3.0-only licensing are retained.

SmartLink protocol behavior was cross-checked against AetherSDR, an independent
GPL-3.0 implementation. OM0RX-xCat's Swift implementation is original to this
project; no AetherSDR source files are included.

